00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:34.080
Another melody,
another beautiful dream.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:40.580
The light shimmered.
The music carried her higher.

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:48.000
♪ Michael, Michael, baby ♪

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.100
♪ Michael, Michael, baby ♪

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:57.360
♪ Your perfume never fades away ♪

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.400
Steeltown Michael Parfum.

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:03.480
Every woman's dream.

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.980
♪ Michael, Michael, baby ♪

